{{- /* The complete machine-wide agent instructions, in reading order.
       Every agent tool but Claude includes this one file, so a new section
       is added here once rather than in each of their wrappers. Claude reads
       the same partials split between CLAUDE.md.tmpl and ~/.claude/rules/,
       so a new partial also gets a rule file there (claude_rules.bats
       fails until it does). A wrapper that passes the key aiShellScriptsSkill
       gets a pointer to the shell-scripts skill instead of that section. */ -}}
